# ALIASES — collapse many git committer identities into one canonical AUTHORS entry.
#
# A single contributor may commit from several (name, email) pairs over time:
# work laptop vs. personal laptop, "Jane Doe" vs. "jane", an old address that
# still surfaces in some clones. List every variant on its own line, all
# pointing at the same right-hand side. The pre-commit hook accepts a commit
# only when its exact (name, email) appears on the LHS of a line here AND the
# RHS exists verbatim in AUTHORS.
#
# Format (strict; both sides matched exactly):
#   <git name> <<git email>> => <AUTHORS entry>
#
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.

